{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_006","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"Authors: Aidan Hogan , Eva Blomqvist , Michael Cochez , Claudia d'Amato , Gerard de Melo , Claudio Gutierrez , José Emilio Labra Gayo , Sabrina Kirrane , Sebastian Neumaier , Axel Polleres , Roberto Navigli , Axel-Cyrille Ngonga Ngomo , Sabbir M. Rashid , Anisa Rula , Lukas Schmelzeisen , Juan Sequeda , Steffen Staab , Antoine Zimmermann","location_hint":"paragraph 21","char_start":888,"char_end":1227,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_007","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"View a PDF of the paper titled Knowledge Graphs, by Aidan Hogan and 17 other authors","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1231,"char_end":1315,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_008","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"Abstract: In this paper we provide a comprehensive introduction to knowledge graphs, which have recently garnered significant attention from both industry and academia in scenarios that require exploiting diverse, dynamic, large-scale collections of data.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1329,"char_end":1584,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_009","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"After some opening remarks, we motivate and contrast various graph-based data models and query languages that are used for knowledge graphs.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1585,"char_end":1725,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_010","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"We discuss the roles of schema, identity, and context in knowledge graphs.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1726,"char_end":1800,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_011","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"We explain how knowledge can be represented and extracted using a combination of deductive and inductive techniques.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1801,"char_end":1917,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_012","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"We summarise methods for the creation, enrichment, quality assessment, refinement, and publication of knowledge graphs.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1918,"char_end":2037,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_013","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"We provide an overview of prominent open knowledge graphs and enterprise knowledge graphs, their applications, and how they use the aforementioned techniques.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":2038,"char_end":2196,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_014","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"We conclude with high-level future research directions for knowledge graphs.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":2197,"char_end":2273,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_a135974ea838_015","source_id":"src_a135974ea838","source_hash":"ff997103e69fabea67ceed1a04ffce8fbf7c434637efdd0b95f28b78c51630dd","text":"Comments:\nRevision from v5: Correcting errata from previous version for entailment/models, and some other minor typos","location_hint":"paragraph 25","char_start":2283,"char_end":2400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T03:29:39.043Z"}
